Bundled FIGfonts
----------------
fonts/*.flf and the generated modules in src/fonts/*.ts embed, byte for byte, the
FIGfonts shipped in the FIGlet 2.2.5 distribution (http://www.figlet.org/,
figlet-2.2.5.tar.gz, SHA-256 bf88c40fd0f077dab2712f54f8d39ac952e4e9f2e1882f1195be9e5e4257417d):

  banner big block bubble digital ivrit lean mini script shadow slant small
  smscript smshadow smslant standard term

FIGlet 2.2.5, its fonts included, is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause License
reproduced in LICENSES/FIGLET.txt:

  Copyright (C) 1991, 1993, 1994 Glenn Chappell and Ian Chai
  Copyright (C) 1996, 1997, 1998, 1999, 2000, 2001 John Cowan
  Copyright (C) 2002 Christiaan Keet
  Copyright (C) 2011 Claudio Matsuoka

Each font's own comment lines (authors, contributors and the original
"Permission is hereby given to modify this font, as long as the modifier's name
is placed on a comment line." grant) are preserved unmodified inside the font
source and exposed at runtime as `font.comment`. Nothing in the fonts has been
modified; if you modify one, add your name on a comment line.

Not bundled
-----------
Popular fonts from the "contributed" FIGlet collection and later collections
(for example Doom, Larry 3D, ANSI Shadow and Calvin S) carry no redistribution
grant, so they are not included. Load them yourself with `parseFont()` if your
use is permitted.

